WEBVTT

00:00.033 --> 00:02.964
[cheerful music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:03.033 --> 00:08.722
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:08.791 --> 00:10.998
[excited chatter]
[兴奋的喋喋不休]

00:11.964 --> 00:15.136
- It's too high.
I can't!
- 太高了。
我不能！

00:15.205 --> 00:17.412
- Cannonball!
Ohh!
- 炮弹！
哦！

00:20.033 --> 00:23.653
- Now you've got water wings.
Try them.
- 现在你有了水翼。
尝试一下。

00:23.722 --> 00:25.171
Hmm?
Huh?
唔？
啊？

00:25.240 --> 00:27.343
- Ahh-ahh-ahh!
- 啊啊啊啊！

00:27.412 --> 00:30.136
- Marco!
- 马可！

00:30.205 --> 00:32.343
- Eeh.
- Marco?
- 呃。
- 马可？

00:32.412 --> 00:36.033
- No, I'm Joshua.
- Okay, bye.
- 不，我是约书亚。
- 好的，再见。

00:37.378 --> 00:38.688
Marco.
马可.

00:38.757 --> 00:40.102
- Polo.
- 波罗。

00:40.171 --> 00:41.895
[both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

00:41.964 --> 00:45.757
Marco!
马可！

00:45.826 --> 00:47.378
[whistle blows]
[哨声响起]

00:47.447 --> 00:50.067
Shady Shoals residents,
out of the pool.
谢迪浅滩居民，
从池子里出来。

00:50.136 --> 00:53.343
- I pooped.
- Come along, Mortimer.
- 我拉屎了。
- 来吧，莫蒂默。

00:55.171 --> 00:57.895
- Huh?
Oh.
- 啊？
哦。

00:57.964 --> 00:59.585
[elephant trumpets]
Huh?
[大象喇叭]
啊？

00:59.653 --> 01:01.619
I'm covered in wrinkles.
我满身皱纹。

01:01.688 --> 01:03.309
- Oh, we all are, dear.
- 哦，我们都是，亲爱的。

01:03.378 --> 01:05.998
I call them oldie foldies.
我称它们为老折叠机。

01:06.067 --> 01:08.619
[strains]
[菌株]

01:08.688 --> 01:10.205
Hurry, Mortimer.
快点，莫蒂默。

01:10.274 --> 01:14.688
Shady Shoals is serving
prune ice cream today.
Shady Shoals 正在服务
今天修剪冰淇淋。

01:14.757 --> 01:17.791
- Dah!
Ice cream, oh, oh!
- 啊！
冰淇淋啊啊啊！

01:17.860 --> 01:20.067
Wait for me!
等我！

01:21.619 --> 01:24.136
- Marco!
- 马可！

01:24.205 --> 01:25.929
Marco!
- [grumbles]
马可！
- [抱怨]

01:25.998 --> 01:28.550
- Marco?
- Yeah, I'm-a Marco!
- 马可？
- 是的，我是 - 马可！

01:28.619 --> 01:30.964
What do you want?
- Oh, I don't want you.
你想要什么？
- 哦，我不需要你。

01:31.033 --> 01:32.309
I want Patrick.
我想要帕特里克。

01:32.378 --> 01:36.033
- Then stop
a-yellin' my name!
- 然后停下来
喊-喊我的名字！

01:36.102 --> 01:37.998
- Ugh.
[softly] Marco.
- 呃。
[轻声]马可。

01:38.067 --> 01:39.929
- Attention, everyone.
- 大家注意了。

01:39.998 --> 01:42.240
We found a lost
elderly gentleman
我们找到了丢失的
老先生

01:42.309 --> 01:44.619
who goes by the name
of Mortimer.
谁叫这个名字
莫蒂默的。

01:44.688 --> 01:47.136
Can anyone claim him?
有人可以认领他吗？

01:51.274 --> 01:53.378
[tires squeal]
[轮胎吱吱声]

01:53.447 --> 01:54.895
[overlapping chatter]
[重叠的喋喋不休]

01:54.964 --> 01:56.722
- Come on, let's move it!
- 来吧，让我们移动它！

01:56.791 --> 01:58.585
I want prune ice cream.
我想要西梅冰淇淋。

01:58.653 --> 02:00.653
all: Ohh.
全体：哦。

02:04.067 --> 02:06.481
[straining]
[紧张]

02:09.171 --> 02:12.585
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

02:12.653 --> 02:15.136
- [straining]
- [紧张]

02:15.205 --> 02:17.929
- Mortimer, ice cream time.
- 莫蒂默，冰淇淋时间到了。

02:17.998 --> 02:20.929
- Ahh!
[panting]
- 啊！
[气喘吁吁]

02:20.998 --> 02:22.998
Ahh.
啊。

02:23.067 --> 02:25.412
[gulps, belches]
[吞咽，打嗝]

02:25.481 --> 02:27.205
[groans]
[呻吟]

02:27.274 --> 02:29.722
Brain freeze!
大脑冻结！

02:34.860 --> 02:36.585
- Clear!
- 清除！

02:36.653 --> 02:38.860
Clear!
清除！

02:38.929 --> 02:41.136
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

02:43.653 --> 02:45.653
- Oh. Ah.
- 哦。啊。

02:49.343 --> 02:51.860
Brain food.
健脑食品。

02:51.929 --> 02:54.722
[gentle music]
[轻柔的音乐]

02:54.791 --> 02:56.481
- Eh?
- 呃？

02:56.550 --> 02:57.998
- Ehh?
- 呃？

02:58.067 --> 03:00.826
- Eh.
[straining]
- 呃。
[紧张]

03:00.895 --> 03:02.136
Oh?
哦？

03:02.205 --> 03:04.447
[laughter]
[笑声]

03:08.033 --> 03:10.171
[straining]
Eh?
[紧张]
呃？

03:12.171 --> 03:14.895
[laughter]
[笑声]

03:14.964 --> 03:18.171
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

03:18.240 --> 03:19.860
[flat-lines]
[平线]

03:19.929 --> 03:22.895
[grumbles]
[抱怨]

03:22.964 --> 03:24.309
- Got you!
- 明白了！

03:24.378 --> 03:26.860
[laughter]
[笑声]

03:26.929 --> 03:28.309
- Marco!
- 马可！

03:28.378 --> 03:30.895
- [grumbles]
- [抱怨]

03:30.964 --> 03:32.067
- Marco!
- 马可！

03:32.136 --> 03:33.516
- You!
- 你！

03:33.585 --> 03:36.102
What I tell youse
about-a yellin' my name?
我告诉你什么
关于——喊我的名字？

03:36.171 --> 03:37.860
- Ahh!
I-I don't remember.
- 啊！
我-我不记得了。

03:37.929 --> 03:39.860
Um, sometimes
it helps me to remember
嗯，有时
它帮助我记住

03:39.929 --> 03:41.378
if I go into a trance.
如果我进入恍惚状态。

03:41.447 --> 03:47.412
I'm seeing a small farmhouse
painted white.
我看到一座小农舍
漆成白色。

03:47.481 --> 03:50.136
Does that have
any significance to you?
那有没有
对你来说有什么意义吗？

03:50.205 --> 03:53.378
- My parents had
a white farmhouse.
- 我的父母有
一座白色的农舍。

03:53.447 --> 03:56.309
- What's this?
A baby has been born.
- 这是什么？
一个婴儿出生了。

03:56.378 --> 03:59.653
A boy.
There is much happiness.
一个男孩。
有很多幸福。

03:59.722 --> 04:02.343
- That's-a me.
I was-a born there.
- 那是-一个我。
我出生在那里。

04:02.412 --> 04:04.378
- They are about
to name the boy...
- 他们是关于
给男孩取名...

04:04.447 --> 04:06.550
- Marco.
They named him Marco.
- 马可。
他们给他起名叫马可。

04:06.619 --> 04:09.102
It's Marco.
Marco!
是马可。
马可！

04:09.171 --> 04:10.550
- Polo.
- 波罗。

04:10.619 --> 04:14.067
- Ahh! If I catch anyone
a-yellin' my name again,
- 啊！如果我抓到任何人
再次呼喊我的名字，

04:14.136 --> 04:15.688
I'm-a gonna hurt them.
我会伤害他们。

04:15.757 --> 04:19.688
- Whoo-hoo!
[screaming]
- 呼呼！
[尖叫]

04:19.757 --> 04:20.964
[groans]
[呻吟]

04:21.033 --> 04:22.447
- Marco.
- Polo.
- 马可。
- 波罗。

04:22.516 --> 04:25.033
- Ah-ha-ha!
Found you!
- 啊哈哈哈！
找到你了！

04:25.102 --> 04:28.171
Now it's your turn
to call Marco.
现在轮到你了
给马可打电话。

04:28.240 --> 04:30.481
- Do I know you,
young man?
- 我认识你吗
年轻人？

04:30.550 --> 04:33.481
- Patrick, it's me.
Remember?
- 帕特里克，是我。
记住？

04:33.550 --> 04:36.240
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
海底♪

04:36.309 --> 04:38.516
- I don't know.
A wizard?
- 我不知道。
巫师？

04:38.585 --> 04:41.067
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

04:41.136 --> 04:42.343
Ehh.
呃。

04:42.412 --> 04:44.895
- SpongeBob SquarePants!
- 海绵宝宝！

04:44.964 --> 04:47.205
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:47.274 --> 04:48.998
- [laughs]
The one and only.
- [笑]
唯一的。

04:49.067 --> 04:52.240
Okay, now it's your turn
to call Marco Polo.
好的，现在轮到你了
给马可波罗打电话。

04:52.309 --> 04:54.412
- Whoa-oh, I can't do that.
- 哇哦，我做不到。

04:54.481 --> 04:57.067
I'm all wrinkled now.
我现在满脸皱纹了。

04:57.136 --> 05:00.412
I do old stuff.
我做旧事。

05:00.481 --> 05:03.067
- Old stuff?
Like what?
- 老东西？
比如什么？

05:03.136 --> 05:06.033
- Check it out.
- 一探究竟。

05:06.102 --> 05:09.274
This is called doddering.
这就是所谓的老态龙钟。

05:09.343 --> 05:11.757
[straining]
[紧张]

05:11.826 --> 05:15.067
Oh, here's another thing
I do now.
哦，这是另一件事
我现在就这么做了。

05:15.136 --> 05:18.033
It's called gumming.
这就是所谓的涂胶。

05:18.102 --> 05:20.309
[lips smacking]
[咂嘴]

05:25.274 --> 05:27.240
Neat, huh?
整洁吧？

05:27.309 --> 05:29.481
Now this part's really fun.
现在这部分真的很有趣。

05:29.550 --> 05:32.791
It's called complaining.
这叫抱怨。

05:32.860 --> 05:37.722
These kids today,
they don't know diddly squat.
今天的这些孩子，
他们不知道蹲着。

05:37.791 --> 05:39.619
- Ah. Hmm.
- 啊。唔。

05:39.688 --> 05:41.791
- Wow, Patrick,
those are all great things,
- 哇，帕特里克，
这些都是伟大的事情，

05:41.860 --> 05:45.653
but wouldn't you rather
go jelly fishing?
但你不想
去钓鱼吗？

05:45.722 --> 05:48.653
- Ohh!
No, that hurts.
- 哦！
不，那很痛。

05:48.722 --> 05:51.757
- We could be sand castles.
- 我们可以是沙堡。

05:51.826 --> 05:54.826
- It's not
structurally sound.
- 不是
结构健全。

05:54.895 --> 05:57.240
- Well, how 'bout
blowing bubbles?
- 嗯，怎么样
吹泡泡？

05:57.309 --> 06:01.274
Nothing bad about a bubble.
泡沫没什么不好的。

06:01.343 --> 06:02.860
- Ooh.
- 哦。

06:02.929 --> 06:04.550
[explodes]
[爆炸]

06:04.619 --> 06:07.274
Are you trying
to kill me, son?
你在尝试吗
儿子，要杀我吗？

06:07.343 --> 06:10.653
- No, I just think
we should act our age.
- 不，我只是觉得
我们应该表现出适合我们年龄的行为。

06:10.722 --> 06:12.722
Remember when
we used to look forward
记得什么时候
我们曾经期待

06:12.791 --> 06:15.481
to rainy days
and building cushion forts?
到下雨天
并建造缓冲堡垒？

06:15.550 --> 06:17.481
- These days,
I only look forward
- 这些天，
我只期待

06:17.550 --> 06:20.240
to my final exit.
到我最后的出口。

06:20.309 --> 06:24.205
- Oh, he was too young.
- 哦，他太年轻了。

06:24.274 --> 06:25.585
- No, I wasn't!
- 不，我没有！

06:25.653 --> 06:29.240
all: No, he wasn't.
We are not young.
所有人：不，他不是。
我们不年轻了。

06:29.309 --> 06:30.964
- Come on, people.
- 来吧，人们。

06:31.033 --> 06:33.516
Just 'cause you're old doesn't
mean you're rotting fish.
只是因为你老了
意味着你的鱼正在腐烂。

06:33.585 --> 06:36.240
You're still vital,
full of life.
你依然充满活力
充满生机。

06:36.309 --> 06:38.171
Fresh.
新鲜的。

06:38.240 --> 06:40.791
- Fresh, you say?
- 你说新鲜？

06:40.860 --> 06:42.550
Ahh.
啊。

06:42.619 --> 06:44.895
- [straining]
- [紧张]

06:46.550 --> 06:48.412
Okay, you young-at-hearters,
好吧，你们这些年轻的心，

06:48.481 --> 06:51.067
today you are gonna climb
that tree.
今天你要攀登
那棵树。

06:51.136 --> 06:53.378
[all grumbling]
[大家都在抱怨]

06:55.274 --> 06:57.102
Yes, yes, that's right!
是的，是的，没错！

06:57.171 --> 06:58.860
Put those flabby arms to use.
让那些松弛的手臂派上用场。

06:58.929 --> 07:02.688
Laugh at your lumbago.
Cackle at your cataracts.
笑你的腰痛。
嘲笑你的白内障。

07:02.757 --> 07:04.964
[all straining, grumbling]
[全都紧张、抱怨]

07:12.585 --> 07:14.447
- Is it nap time yet?
- 午睡时间到了吗？

07:14.516 --> 07:17.136
- Nope! It's time
for the dance party!
- 没有！是时候了
为了舞会！

07:17.205 --> 07:19.240
Everybody on board.
每个人都在船上。

07:19.309 --> 07:21.550
[all muttering]
[大家嘀咕]

07:24.791 --> 07:27.895
Are you ready to get down?
你准备好下来了吗？

07:27.964 --> 07:30.585
- Yeah.
[all snoring]
- 是的。
[全都打呼噜]

07:30.653 --> 07:34.240
- No, not like that.
Like this!
- 不，不是那样的。
像这样！

07:34.309 --> 07:36.309
[ragtime music]
[拉格泰姆音乐]

07:36.378 --> 07:38.171
- Now--now--now--
Now you're talking.
- 现在--现在--现在--
现在你在说话了。

07:38.240 --> 07:40.860
- Now let's kick it up
a hundred notches.
- 现在让我们开始吧
一百个凹口。

07:40.929 --> 07:42.481
[dance music]
Yeah!
[舞曲]
是啊！

07:42.550 --> 07:45.343
[all grumbling]
- Oh, what's happening?
[大家都在抱怨]
- 哦，发生了什么事？

07:45.412 --> 07:46.895
[flat-line]
[平线]

07:46.964 --> 07:48.964
- Oh, clear!
- 噢，清楚了！

07:50.585 --> 07:53.205
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

07:53.274 --> 07:55.757
[laughs]
[笑]

07:55.826 --> 07:57.550
- Isn't it great
to get outdoors
- 这不是很棒吗
到户外去

07:57.619 --> 08:00.240
with the fresh air
and sunshine?
和新鲜空气
和阳光？

08:00.309 --> 08:02.274
- Stop this rug!
- 停止这块地毯！

08:02.343 --> 08:05.757
Bunny Buns.
Bunny Buns.
兔子包子。
兔子包子。

08:05.826 --> 08:09.826
all: Bunny Buns!
Bunny Buns!
全体：兔子包子！
兔子包子！

08:09.895 --> 08:12.412
- Bunny Buns?
That's a good idea.
- 兔子面包？
这是个好主意。

08:12.481 --> 08:13.964
Nothing makes people
feel young
没有什么能让人
感觉年轻

08:14.033 --> 08:16.274
like arcade games,
grease and sugar.
像街机游戏，
油脂和糖。

08:16.343 --> 08:17.550
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

08:17.619 --> 08:19.516
[children chattering, laughing]
[孩子们叽叽喳喳、大笑]

08:19.585 --> 08:21.516
- This is fun!
- 这很有趣！

08:21.585 --> 08:28.791
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:32.067 --> 08:34.585
- You're coming in too fast
on the bridge
- 你来得太快了
在桥上

08:34.653 --> 08:37.964
and you're blowing clams.
你在吹蛤蜊。

08:38.033 --> 08:40.826
- Ah.
Ohh!
- 啊。
哦！

08:40.895 --> 08:42.378
[crying]
[哭泣]

08:42.447 --> 08:45.205
- Now that's
what I call jazz.
- 现在就是这样
我称之为爵士乐。

08:45.274 --> 08:47.102
- Ha ha. So sorry.
- 哈哈。很抱歉。

08:47.171 --> 08:49.171
Let me just take this.
让我拿着这个。

08:52.136 --> 08:54.171
- [grumbles]
Hmm.
- [抱怨]
嗯。

09:01.516 --> 09:04.309
- I can help you with that.
- 我可以帮你。

09:04.378 --> 09:06.585
[groaning]
[呻吟]

09:09.343 --> 09:11.688
Eww.
- Hey!
呃。
- 嘿！

09:11.757 --> 09:14.102
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

09:14.171 --> 09:15.585
- [gurgling]
- [咯咯声]

09:15.653 --> 09:19.274
- Old people, behave!
- Whoa!
——老人家，守规矩！
- 哇！

09:19.343 --> 09:20.998
[dinging]
[叮叮]

09:21.067 --> 09:23.102
23 skidoo!
23 滑雪！

09:23.171 --> 09:25.998
- Oh.
[groans]
- 哦。
[呻吟]

09:26.067 --> 09:29.929
- SpongeBob!
- 海绵宝宝！

09:29.998 --> 09:33.757
I'm drowning.
[straining]
我快淹死了。
[紧张]

09:33.826 --> 09:36.033
- I'm coming, Patrick!
- 我来了，帕特里克！

09:40.516 --> 09:42.205
- [grumbles]
- [抱怨]

09:42.274 --> 09:45.136
- Thanks, old-timer.
- Oh, you're welcome.
- 谢谢，老前辈。
- 哦，不客气。

09:45.205 --> 09:47.998
What, who you calling
old-timer?
什么，你打电话给谁
老前辈？

09:51.412 --> 09:53.136
Whoa.
哇哦。

09:53.205 --> 09:56.378
Where have the years gone?
岁月都去哪儿了？

09:56.447 --> 09:58.653
[both groaning]
[两人都呻吟]

10:03.205 --> 10:05.895
- I'm losing steam.
- 我失去了动力。

10:05.964 --> 10:08.033
[groans]
[呻吟]

10:08.102 --> 10:09.516
- Wait, hey, man.
- 等等，嘿，伙计。

10:09.585 --> 10:13.205
Don't make a scene in front
of all my old friends.
不要在前面大吵大闹
我所有的老朋友。

10:15.860 --> 10:18.619
Oh.
Ohh.
哦。
哦。

10:18.688 --> 10:21.136
Now I can't dodder.
现在我不能再犹豫了。

10:21.205 --> 10:22.447
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

10:22.516 --> 10:24.240
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

10:24.309 --> 10:26.343
Here you go, friend.
给你，朋友。

10:26.412 --> 10:28.309
[flat-lines]
Huh?
[平线]
啊？

10:28.378 --> 10:30.688
[groans]
[呻吟]

10:30.757 --> 10:32.240
- Got you!
- 明白了！

10:32.309 --> 10:33.653
[laughter]
[笑声]

10:33.722 --> 10:35.895
- You got me again.
- 你又抓住了我。

10:35.964 --> 10:37.826
- Marco.
- Polo.
- 马可。
- 波罗。

10:37.895 --> 10:39.998
- Marco!
- Oh, that's it!
- 马可！
- 哦，就是这样！

10:40.067 --> 10:42.205
I said I was-a gonna
clobber the next-a person
我说我是-将会
打击下一个人

10:42.274 --> 10:43.688
what-a calls my name!
什么叫我的名字！

10:43.757 --> 10:46.309
- No one clobbers Clarabelle!
- 没有人能打败克拉拉贝尔！

10:46.378 --> 10:49.550
[engine revs, tires screech]
[发动机转速、轮胎尖叫声]

10:49.619 --> 10:52.274
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

10:52.343 --> 10:55.033
- Oh, Marco?
- 哦，马可？

10:55.102 --> 10:56.895
- Polo.
- 波罗。

10:59.378 --> 11:02.309
[mellow music]
[柔和的音乐]

11:02.378 --> 11:09.412
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪